<title>INDONESIA: Intiland says receives 40 bln rph loans.</title>
<headline>Intiland says receives 40 bln rph loans.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian property company PT Dharmala Intiland said on Friday it had obtained 40 billion rupiah in loans from a syndicate of six local banks.</p>
<p>It said the 10-year loan will be used to build the Wisma Dharmala tower in Surabaya. Syndicate members were Panin Bank, Bank Tamara, Bank Pikko, Bank Universal, Bank Metropolitan and Bank Nusantara Parahyangan.</p>
<p>Dharmala Intiland is a unit of the Dharmala Group.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
